  <item>
    <title>vol.06 行业固化，I&apos;m Alive。和房企工作者的杂谈。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67ffbe49cdd692da15c4b465</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67ffbe49cdd692da15c4b465</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Apr 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期节目是我和我的家人和朋友Gavin就我们各自所处的行业：科研和房企，讨论的行业固化、转变自身心态、探索个人生活等的小小讨论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在几个月暂停播客的日子里，我也在思考和挣扎未来的路该怎么走。虽然还不知道未来会怎样，但是依然想在自己感兴趣的播客上走下去，感谢各位的收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="168">02:48</a> 你喜欢自己的行业吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="471">07:51</a> 实习其实用处不大？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a> 越往一个方向走越难脱离这个方向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> 打造个人品牌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1242">20:42</a> 研究生的处境</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1453">24:13</a> 个人要有一技之长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1552">25:52</a> 行业固化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">29:28</a> 找到生活的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a> 儿时以为自己与众不同</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2212">36:52</a> 大量成功人士涌入播客</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2247">37:27</a> 录播客帮助自我思考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2367">39:27</a> 预约录制“哪吒2”</span></p>]]></description>
