    <guid isPermaLink="false">674be4abc3b2a2f334bb46f0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 01 Dec 2024 04:36:04 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，本期节目是我和我的朋友观潮在9月22日观看完电影《出走的决心》之后录制的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>隔了两个多月的时间再来听我们两个对这部电影不太一样的出发点，还是觉得特别有意思。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="31">00:31</a> 一种典型的家庭模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="166">02:46</a> 原生家庭的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="564">09:24</a> 是否考虑过和父母一起住</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 为什么要让父母为了我们的孩子去牺牲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 结婚会改变一个人吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1363">22:43</a> 人生是自己的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 个人觉得电影的情绪高潮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 具备什么因素可以出走</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2881">48:01</a> 四次出走的时机</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">51:05</a> 心要野，歌词</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljgaWi8U5tozEkSwiewwDu2NnS-h.m4a" length="50870579" type="audio/mp4"/>
